g"},{"id":1221105,"name":"Tadashi Miyazawa","role":"Solomon Moto (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oTKVqD3r6j4d264ifrxoH1ibxDb.jpg"},{"id":552339,"name":"Kazuhiro Yamaji","role":"Mr. Bakura (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fgGTdhTiWViGmjl2kABHWzLIpZ0.jpg"},{"id":119143,"name":"Kana Hanazawa","role":"Sera (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9UTBlNRopSOKyoWnCm74tyHOfR1.jpg"},{"id":224413,"name":"Satoshi Hino","role":"Mani (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8ZJIiwIVF2zDyyFr7oXewj0eEuu.jpg"},{"id":91872,"name":"Kendo Kobayashi","role":"Kudaragi (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bpFuq1vb4cexlmchDfMRNavQCRY.jpg"},{"id":1679,"name":"Nozomu Sasaki","role":"Shadi Shin (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7usoPlvc9Xa1rDA2vxmVi0OvLDb.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Yu-Gi-Oh!: The Dark Side of Dimensions","overview":"Yugi Muto e i suoi amici sono all'ultimo anno di liceo e stanno decidendo cosa fare in futuro. Nel frattempo Seito Kaiba ha commissionato degli scavi per recuperare i pezzi del Millenium Puzzle, nella speranza di far rivivere l'anima del suo rivale Atem per far aumentare il proprio punteggio. Ma gli scavi vengono interrotti da Diva, che sfida Kaiba a Dual Monsters. Yugi e Kaiba si sono già scontrati diverse volte in passato ma nel nuovo duello metteranno in gioco l'orgoglio e tutte le esperienze passate."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Yu-Gi-Oh!: The Dark Side of Dimensions","overview":"Having faced each other on countless occasions, Yugi and Kaiba again put their pride and experience to the test in a duel that transcends dimensions.","tagline":"Back to the stage of battle."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"千年パズルを完成させたことにより、≪闇遊戯≫という、もう１人の人格を呼び覚ました武藤遊戯。海馬コーポレーションの社長にして決闘者(デュエリスト)の頂点に君臨する海馬瀬人や、仲間たちと数々の死闘を繰り広げたが、過去との因縁により、もう1人の自分との闘いを余儀なくされ、遊戯と闇遊戯はついに決別し、別々の道へ旅立つこととなった--。そうして、闇遊戯との最後の決闘を終えて、日常を取り戻したかに見えた遊戯たち。その前に現れた謎の少年≪藍神(あいがみ)≫。そして、世界中で次々と起こる謎の失踪事件。ただひたすら千年パズルを探し求める海馬。すべてのピースが合わさるとき、再び決闘（デュエル）の幕が切って落とされる！","tagline":"新たな未来を拓くのは　意志か、絆か、理想か――――。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vx9nngctwY0OX0HF89DFSSA7pOj.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vx9nngctwY0OX0HF89DFSSA7pOj.png","language":"en","width":1263,"height":538}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fLxIlQwDwzxdBUD8mmkMeYu5c7b.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fLxIlQwDwzxdBUD8mmkMeYu5c7b.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/37dOFHvRN8Fgfap76C6ChxzhbYs.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/37dOFHvRN8Fgfap76C6ChxzhbYs.jpg","language":"it","width":850,"height":1191},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ti0CRprP9iSg9IDadTZ3TFnuczS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ti0CRprP9iSg9IDadTZ3TFnuczS.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nFQkn1KE0Is3FUW0yPPgdVvCnlo.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nFQkn1KE0Is3FUW0yPPgdVvCnlo.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j5itNPXLzwr4Jd80sMHCx36mIyj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j5itNPXLzwr4Jd80sMHCx36mIyj.jpg","language":"en","width":998,"height":1406},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8GtxRe88pN2dMxysfM5Guz09O8S.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8GtxRe88pN2dMxysfM5Guz09O8S.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rsnGeUC6croOMzcl6CJdxRxsp5A.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rsnGeUC6croOMzcl6CJdxRxsp5A.jpg","language":"en","width":1200,"height":1600},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original